<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-epitaph-wanglingyuan" book-id="b-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts" chapter-id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts" source-id="s-epitaph-wanglingyuan-daitof00792">
  <p id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p000" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">魏故假黃鉞太傅大司馬<persName id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p000:m0010" ref="2a3_ci1_y4y">廣陽文獻王</persName>妃墓誌銘</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">祖<persName id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001:m0001" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAA">琛</persName>，齊司徒從事中郎。祖母彭城劉氏，父義恭，宋太宰江夏文獻王。父<persName id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001:m0032" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA">翊</persName>，魏侍中司空孝獻公。母河南<persName id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001:m0046" ref="r2j_x7x_hhl">元氏</persName>，父<persName id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001:m0050" ref="p3f_nlh_ukk">澄</persName>，假黃鉞太傅任城文宣王。妃姓王，諱<persName id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001:m0068" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAAA">令媛</persName>，琅邪臨沂人，齊尚書僕射<persName id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p001:m0082" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>之曾孫也。</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">亦既有行，來儀蕃邸，率禮公宮，剋循法度。</p>
  <p id="c-epitaph-wanglingyuan-excerpts:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">粵以武定二年歲在甲子八月庚申合葬於武城之北原。</p>
</text>
